# Pairs with LinkedOnlyAfterSeed. A link reported while the donor's digest is still being read publishes a half-seeded sibling.
MODULE: DigestReturnsBeforeSeedDone
TARGET: LinkedOnlyAfterSeed
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the link returns before the sibling's seeding has finished
PERTURBS: ServeDigest

--- FIND
    /\ seed = "digest"
    /\ seed' = "done"
--- REPLACE
    /\ seed = "digest"
    \* MUTATION: the seeding is not marked complete
    /\ seed' = "digest"
--- END
